<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Basis mixed, movement slow.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Basis mixed, movement slow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean meal basis offers were mixed on Monday with weakness noted in several locations, particularly in the northern Corn Belt.</p>
<p>Dealers said breakdowns and scheduled downtime had, however, cut supplies in the South where the market was tight.</p>
<p>&quot;It is cheap in the North and firm in the South,&quot; one soymeal broker said.</p>
<p>They noted the outlook for meal demand had been dimmed by USDA's quarterly Hogs and Pigs Report Friday, which indicated that farmers did not appear to be expanding the herd, contrary to many expectations.  </p>
